      },
      "fix": "Launch this standard-library-only worker fixture with sys._base_executable. Keep worker_crashed, structured attempt, process/pipe/thread/lock cleanup and next-request recovery assertions; additionally require completion before the sleep ends.",
      "runtime_changed": false
    },
    "downloader_lock": {
      "cause": "Popen targets the Windows venv redirector; kill/wait for it does not synchronize with the separate lock-owning interpreter termination. Job cleanup is asynchronous; this is real temporary contention, not a stale lock file.",
